<title>UK: Beta Finance adds 2.5 bln escudo to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Beta Finance adds 2.5 bln escudo to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was</p>
<p>announced by joint lead managers Citibank Portugal SA and</p>
<p>Citibank International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BETA FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT   *7.5 BLN PTE   COUPON     6.85	MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    FULL FEES   0.35</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100 (M) 1-10-50</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC   0.25</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 5.0 BILLION ESCUDOS ON THE</p>
<p>		09.OCT.96.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
